  "question": {
    "en": "4. Administration Notes (please include here any protocol deviations, task accommodations, unusual circumstances, or other issues with administration.* e.g., the busy parent task was 30 seconds longer than intended due to RA error.* e.g., baby had a pacifier for the entire activity.* e.g., unable to use paints due to child allergy.* e.g., parent did not want to change diaper on camera.* e.g., parent unable to sit on floor with baby, chair and table provided."
